{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：17:30 2026-09-08 HKT</p>\n\n<p>38歲的TVB小生何廣沛（Matthew）去年8月宣布向圈外女友Sarah求婚成功，早前出席活動時，透露已到英國拍攝婚紗相，婚禮將在今年12月在香港舉行，屆時兄弟姊妹團將由六男十女組成。準新娘Sarah Miu近日在社交平台分享婚前水著性感美照，大晒好身材。</p>\n<h2>何廣沛未婚妻晒身材</h2>\n<p>何廣沛未婚妻Sarah前日（6日）在IG分享照片，見到她穿上酒紅色比堅尼，在酒店頂樓的無邊際泳池中大騷曼妙身段。在廣闊的城市景觀下，Sarah展現出自信笑容及勻稱身材，其中一張背面照更盡顯其完美曲線，畫面相當吸睛。Sarah寫道：「Summer, perfectly reset.（夏天，完美重置）」。</p>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛去年8月8日宣布婚訊。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be96d161cdd6b8d79ac941bf76072110/2025-08/matthew_hkp_1754629201_3694419971557816994_39901440.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛早知女友以前有過一段婚姻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c8e0503120ccdd9cf3674e51f8c17065/2023-09/KakaoTalk_20230911_221804140_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛有新戀情，多謝記者轉達前緋聞女友朱晨麗的祝福。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e7bf5c2fcdb48f288b4f202f0d4d2246/2023-09/KakaoTalk_20230911_221804140_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sarah Miu外形不輸明星。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e85a1ce7dda890225c858bd6739e7b6f/2024-04/sarahmiu_1468060839_1290510310603969405_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah前日（6日）在IG分享水著靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d490b0cb126febe215165d940e25de8/2026-09/HO_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah大晒弗爆身材。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/adf920bdbc2f297974563e3cf68e955b/2026-09/HO_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sarah的泳照未知是否由未婚夫何廣沛操刀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/99b48b4229ccd064f7ba039ccd9726be/2026-09/HO_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛對未婚妻Sarah的美照，留言心心眼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/821f5d9cc720b9eeb5d2cbdf1b594fac/2026-09/CAP1_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah長相甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97cad63a2b82b2e54873d487c0279297/2025-08/sarahmiu_1477491770_1369622695993695108_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah不時盛裝出席活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1a8cedfde184e009fe4d3f46a8ede7e2/2025-08/sarahmiu_1501917687_1574522141783884709_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛與未婚妻Sarah都是愛狗之人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a5171fe19589816c626cbeb3b36f1345/2025-08/sarahmiu_1672057010_3001754227099380324_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah身材纖瘦。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/540b36b927bb3fa879f41116dde6dd4c/2025-08/sarahmiu_1712315073_3339463340128290702_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah近月頻頻晒收花相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e57e105741f849301c6af93659d9e6a6/2025-08/sarahmiu_1724325350_3440212841977144062_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah熱愛運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37e22f2aabbb20d0ceabd33dc939128c/2025-08/sarahmiu_1733802210_3519710506728888792_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah熱愛運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5470ed3f053c395597a2a8193f72a1a8/2025-08/sarahmiu_1733802210_3519710506737288327_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah頻頻收花。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b391c8d2e8262a7417a7e18e1078eb83/2025-08/sarahmiu_1754115417_3690110031971844953_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah長相甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2ed2046145abf4e6a71a4ed171ba707/2025-08/sarahmiu_1754115417_3690110031854333034_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛與未婚妻Sarah都非常愛狗狗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15decf67ced3567abb8ffc0be76ed7fd/2025-08/sarahmiu_1754115417_3690110032147976170_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛曾於IG分享睇波打卡照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/63250c9bd1abb3ba918dcbdb25a0743c/2024-04/matthew_hkp_1712482869_3340870910767027346_39901440.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sarah Miu同樣穿上球衣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b6ede94c86d063da94bf265b4bc811a/2024-04/sarahmiu_1712493894_3340963443942960463_84269_mp4_snapshot_00_00_766.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"各自晒出伴侶視角照低調放閃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e61195ef11ea6644efe1b5799c8791c7/2024-04/sarahmiu_1712493894_3340963443942960463_84269_mp4_snapshot_00_02_150.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛未婚妻Sarah Miu任職公關。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff32eb6bbc2412837ff320e1f706b5c4/2024-04/sarahmiu_1399730797_717316380424321181_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sarah Miu被爆曾離婚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a1728b62fb813a765b52a5abff156ba/2024-04/sarahmiu_1408871411_793993405104568550_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛對未婚妻Sarah Miu被抹黑一事，忍不住發聲反擊網民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27671d6dc9c6fe020ed1bad3e161c60b/2024-04/sarahmiu_1413762906_835026239864617553_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sarah Miu不時做「跟得女友」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/50d83191617d3fe5a56937ea0fc49331/2024-04/sarahmiu_1413901448_836188414570314655_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sarah Miu與何廣沛共同養狗狗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aaf8e816137663c8960e5d24c29e0208/2024-04/sarahmiu_1672057010_3001754227099380324_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛與Sarah感情穩定，婚禮於今年底舉行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d3deb7ab02dba41abf6f700e0a60e9f/2024-04/sarahmiu_1698156343_3220691303323521880_84269.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛獲未婚妻支持演藝事業。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8fb49662989ebca826e8fc9fb398d052/2024-04/sarahmiu_1698156343_3220691303331899915_84269.jpg\"/>\n<h2>何廣沛見未婚妻晒身材留「心心眼」</h2>\n<p>照片曝光後，Sarah獲未婚夫何廣沛留下三個「心心眼」表情符號，大讚未婚妻的火辣身材。此外，何廣沛的一眾圈中好友如譚嘉儀、陳曉華、王嘉慧、陳楨怡、陳凱琳等也有留言，大讚「this girl is on fire」、「Waaaaaaaa 不得了」，可見Sarah的人緣相當不錯。</p>\n<h2>何廣沛未婚妻曾離婚</h2>\n<p>據悉，何廣沛的未婚妻Sarah中文名為「苗承諾」，年過30歲，家境富裕。她曾到英國留學，大學畢業後返港在著名公關公司任職，並於2020年自組公關公司做老闆，主要承接品牌宣傳業務。不過Sarah曾被爆有過一段約1年的婚姻，而何廣沛承認知道未婚妻的過去，並大方表示對離婚一事毫不在意。</p>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛2018年憑《跳躍生命線》奪得「飛躍進步男藝員」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/26bb9d2abde8752da1cc686abd350c33/2023-03/_2018121621144118752.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛在《萬千星輝頒獎典禮2025》憑《新聞女王2》首奪「最佳男配角」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/97fecdfdd76722eeaf58ca8f82e0ebf1/2026-01/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-06_at_2_50_48_PM_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛坦言沒料到得獎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/be2847afc4c04bc39f8992dc5508247b/2026-01/HO_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛憑台慶劇《金式森林》、《新聞女王2》角逐《萬千星輝頒獎典禮》最佳男配角。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbd98da1c758b4ad6289502d9511814d/2025-12/HO_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛自爆從小有聽力障礙，是先天性問題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2521759889c40b6ec5179082ed5221c/2025-12/HO_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛從小學已發現有聽力障礙，高低分貝都聽不到，試過戴助聽器。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3afd448441363265e2a0f84ff286130/2025-12/HO_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛2012年藝訓班出身，2014年獲吳啟華欽點做《女人俱樂部》飾演年青版「姚子倫（Alan）」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cb71d67c181459f0285e2811a28280c6/2024-01/Anjay_with_Guy.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛自小就有大眼睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21e6fa542329c82e583e7ae565e26cad/2024-01/170644137924683.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛有份演出《新聞女王》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2505c283e215a5016b3eb0174d8ccca/2023-11/VS--dplayer-7_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱晨麗與何廣沛在《大醬園》合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e8f40fed3ba54bcf42f7fd4bb9be492/2025-08/71.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱晨麗與何廣沛在《大醬園》飾演情侶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb7f207fa225825745ed13675015a86b/2025-08/64_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛31歲生日，朱晨麗曾於網上晒「婚照」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d54e91d822a9c2a2ece990174436429b/2025-08/73.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛與朱晨麗以前經常情侶檔現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/38bed72557b81f8e7dc94dda77aeaa88/2023-09/WhatsApp_Image_2023-03-23_at_16_46_43.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱晨麗與何廣沛於2017年傳出撻着。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cc0297e2d73d93e40582ef6a16362870/2025-08/61_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱晨麗與何廣沛被指一吻定情。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/272548cdf14eff68039caf44423a0df5/2025-08/66.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱晨麗與何廣沛曾經多度合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dbe7dce209c48e75c05261d748ee75c2/2025-08/65.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛曾多次被見到出入朱晨麗屋企，傳出發展至同居階段。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb6a1dfb1d0a801b185f00ca6a00bb78/2023-09/169444315879140.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛在2020年與陳曉華拍攝《異搜店》時傳出緋聞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6a8e9bd3fb49b02f70eea3c912c4cc3e/2025-12/A_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"指何廣沛在片場對陳曉華照顧有加，更曾陪她去找廁所而雙雙離開拍攝現場良久。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2b83b85d925c68045169e784b42954a/2025-12/b_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛同陳曉華表示沒有撻着。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94c3e5461794a0b2db799bdde134a033/2025-12/C.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"何廣沛同陳曉華事後否認，堅稱只是好朋友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/531439ef3332dcf896328e705a9d1cd8/2025-12/D.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-08T14:15:09.331642+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":624,"images":49,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}